{"ID":"20240513082953-7z1xug9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082953-7z1xug9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082953-7z1xug9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175342-tv1bvyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175342-tv1bvyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175342-tv1bvyy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:384,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:384\u0026#125;","title":"336","type":"doc","updated":"20240515105855"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513175342-tv1bvyy","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 879px;","id":"20240513175342-tv1bvyy","updated":"20240515105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237-5 S, N"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"62歲，偏瘦 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"05/01/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 因胃癌，病人的胃切除了百分之七十五"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 服用膠囊. 但效果不如湯劑"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 大便淡黃, 運動後下利.("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"運動過後, 體內循環加速，陽氣旺盛, 因此體內毒素可藉大便排出."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 口渴尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 體力很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 不覺飢餓, 但胃口好. "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 無heartburn(胃酸反逆造成的燒心感)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 運動後, 出少許汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大有力, 勞脈("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人有此脈, 是由於過多勞力工作所致. 不同於因濕盛引起之勞脈. 因病人運動過後, 不覺勞累."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃厚乾("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表燥熱, 病人因做過胃切除手術, 只剩百分之二十五的胃, 但胃熱度仍在, 故有此舌象，對此人來說算正常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方同四月十日, 加陳皮三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛甘發散, 加強胃口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人做過胃切除手術, 導致胃的營養逆流至臉部, 故見面色微黃."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宜多食芝麻, 海藻."}]}]}]}]}